UPDATE inform.politician_context SET reasoning = 'Blanked 2026-10-08 (migration 1908). 🔴🔴 THE EVIDENCE DESCRIBES A DIFFERENT PERSON. This row is State Senator Maria Elena Durazo''s research filed under Assembly Member Jasmeet Kaur Bains. 🔑 ALL TWENTY-THREE OF THE ROWS FILED UNDER BAINS ARE DURAZO''S, and the proof needs no page: every one of them cites sd24.senate.ca.gov, a STATE SENATE DISTRICT SITE, under an ASSEMBLY MEMBER; the record credited is entirely of SENATE bills, and in California the lead author of an SB sits in the Senate; and three of the rows name Durazo outright -- "Durazo authored SB-567 (Homelessness Prevention Act)" and "As a labor leader and state senator Durazo has consistently backed strict limits on corporate political spending". The biography given is Durazo''s too: former UNITE HERE General Vice President for Immigration, Diversity and Civil Rights, arrested 13+ times in nonviolent civil rights protests, author of Health4All and of SB 52 creating an independent redistricting commission for the City of Los Angeles. Jasmeet Kaur Bains is a family physician representing a Kern County Assembly district. She has never served in the State Senate. The chair being removed is 3, read from Season 2. A chair must rest on evidence about the person it is shown under, so there is nothing here to keep and the spoke is left empty. ⚠ THIS IS NOT A JUDGEMENT THAT THE MEMBER HAS NO POSITION -- it is that this row never contained their evidence. Re-research from their own record is owed. The sources examined are kept below so the next reader does not derive this again from scratch.', sources = ARRAY['https://leginfo.legislature.ca.gov/faces/billNavClient.xhtml?bill_id=202320240SB567', 'https://sd24.senate.ca.gov/']::text[], updated_at = now()
 WHERE season_id = '86d893a1-c1a2-4bbf-b4e5-69ec43221194' AND politician_id = '539874fc-489f-4643-9b1a-923aca6cc2c1'::uuid AND topic_id = '669cac97-66a6-4087-b036-936fbe62efb3'::uuid;
